{"case_id": "chaozhou_male_19720108_P002-Q7", "domain": "relationship", "question": "命主的男女关系和婚姻情况？", "expected_answer": "C", "predicted_answer": "C", "raw_answer": "命主八字为辛亥、辛丑、戊戌、丁巳。日主戊土生于丑月，天干双辛伤官，地支丑戌相刑、巳亥相冲，火土旺而水财藏而不透，正财癸水被己土所克，妻星弱而受制，婚姻宫相刑，先天婚姻不顺之象。男命行运逆排，虚龄2岁起运，24至33岁行戊戌大运。此运日主旺极，比肩重重，克财之力强，但遇财星透出之流年仍有婚缘。1996年丙子流年（虚龄25岁），正财子水出现，与月柱辛丑天合地合，子丑合入妻星之库，触发婚姻，故此运内成婚。然子水正财被丑土合化为忌，妻星受困，又原局丑戌刑，婚姻宫受损，主妻子易有情绪或精神困扰，性格过于情绪化，影响感情。此正应选项C。丁酉运以后虽有变化，但并非初婚时间。故断C。\n\n最终答案：C", "correct": true, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "chaozhou_male_19720108_P002-Q7", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2024_b1a_prime_R1_P0_G0\\details_2024_b1a_prime_R1_P0_G0.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 82363, "response_id": "c058994c-3ba7-468c-8188-e0f9f605bd4e", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 252, "completion_tokens": 4910, "total_tokens": 5162, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 4658}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 124}}
